  "historyNote": "#8024, eff 7-1-04; ss by #9991, eff 9-16-11, EXPIRED: 9-16-19; renumbered by #12603 (formerly Ed 507.39) New. #12898, INTERIM, eff 10-11-19, EXPIRED: 4-8-20 New. #13023, Emergency Rule, eff 4-9-20, EXPIRES: 10-6-20; ss by #13099, eff 9-11-20; ss by #14617, eff 6-12-26, EXPIRES: 6-12-36",
